        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>一天考过科目一最全知识点</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 20px;\n    background: #f9d8e0;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 560px;\n    background: #fdfdfd;\n    border: 2px dashed #f2a0b8;\n    padding: 14px 18px 24px 18px;\n    position: relative;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .title-bar {\n    background: #d9261c;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 8px 4px;\n    margin: 0 0 12px 0;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .section-header {\n    color: #d9261c;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    margin: 14px 0 6px 0;\n  }\n  .item {\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    color: #222;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    margin: 3px 0;\n  }\n  .sub-item {\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    color: #222;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    margin: 3px 0 3px 26px;\n  }\n  .hl-orange {\n    background-color: #f6a35c;\n    padding: 0 2px;\n  }\n  .hl-yellow {\n    background-color: #f7e94a;\n    padding: 0 2px;\n  }\n  .circle-note {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 78px;\n    right: 14px;\n    width: 62px;\n    height: 62px;\n    border: 2.5px solid #d9261c;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    transform: rotate(-8deg);\n  }\n  .circle-note span {\n    color: #29b6d8;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"title-bar\">一天考过科目一最全知识点！</div>\n\n  <div class=\"circle-note\"><span>超全</span></div>\n\n  <div class=\"section-header\">三、酒驾相关</div>\n  <div class=\"item\">1.公安机关交通管理部门<span class=\"hl-orange\">约束至酒醒</span>。</div>\n  <div class=\"item\">2.处200-2000元罚款，吊销驾驶证。</div>\n  <div class=\"item\">3.<span class=\"hl-orange\">五年内不得重新取得机动车驾驶证</span>。</div>\n  <div class=\"item\">4.血液酒精含量：</div>\n  <div class=\"sub-item\">a)<span class=\"hl-orange\">20-80mg/ml</span>，饮酒驾驶；　b)<span class=\"hl-orange\">80-100mg/ml</span>，醉驾。</div>\n\n  <div class=\"section-header\">四、行驶</div>\n  <div class=\"item\">1.通过路口交替使用远近光灯。</div>\n  <div class=\"item\">2.不靠山体的车比较危险，<span class=\"hl-orange\">会车时先走</span>。</div>\n  <div class=\"item\">3.高速路会车时，<span class=\"hl-yellow\">150米外</span>，改为近光灯。</div>\n  <div class=\"item\">4.站3口5:在站点(公交车站，消防站等)30米内，路口、窄路等50米内不得停车。</div>\n  <div class=\"item\">5.实习期间，应让<span class=\"hl-yellow\">3年以上驾龄陪驾</span>。</div>\n  <div class=\"item\">6.在路口，靠路口中心点位应该<span class=\"hl-orange\">左侧转弯</span>。</div>\n  <div class=\"item\">7.右方道路来车先行，然后看谁的右方没车就谁先行。</div>\n  <div class=\"item\">8.转弯车辆让直行车辆先行。</div>\n  <div class=\"item\">9.准备进入环形路口的让<span class=\"hl-yellow\">已在路口内的车</span>先行。</div>\n  <div class=\"item\">10.右转弯车让左转弯车辆先行如遇特殊车辆执行任务，不受规则限制，<span class=\"hl-orange\">应直接让行</span>。</div>\n  <div class=\"item\">11.当路口没有交通信号灯时，<span class=\"hl-orange\">减速慢行</span>。</div>\n  <div class=\"item\">12.路口已经过了转弯的地点，只能继续向前行驶</div>\n  <div class=\"item\">13.驾驶机动车在道路上追逐竞驶，情节恶劣<span class=\"hl-orange\">处拘役，并处罚金</span>。</div>\n  <div class=\"item\">14.撞人问题:是否逃逸，逃逸与死亡时间前后</div>\n  <div class=\"sub-item\">a)撞人没逃逸，<span class=\"hl-orange\">3年以下</span>；</div>\n  <div class=\"sub-item\">b)撞人逃跑或撞伤逃跑后，未致人死亡，<span class=\"hl-orange\">3~7年</span>；</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
